msgctxt "68_Short-Haired High School Girl"
msgid "They went up the street. You know, toward the theater?"
msgstr "Subieron por la calle. Creo que al teatro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Hair Bun High School Girl"
msgid "They really stood out. I bet a lot of other people saw\\r\nthem, too."
msgstr "Llamaban bastante la atención. Apuesto a que muchas otras personas los vieron también."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "Excuse me, do you have a moment?"
msgstr "Disculpen, ¿puedo preguntarles algo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Hair Bun High School Girl
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "104_Hair Bun High School Girl"
msgid "Hm? What's up?"
msgstr "¿Eh? Claro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Have you seen a group of yakuza around here? They probably\\r\nhad someone who looked all beat up with them..."
msgstr "¿Han visto un grupo de yakuzas por aquí? Puede que llevaran a alguien golpeado con ellos..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Short-Haired High School Girl"
msgid "Oh yeah, I saw them! They were dragging some guy through\\r\ntown."
msgstr "¡Ah, sí, los vi! Estaban arrastrando a un tipo\\r\npor la ciudad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Hair Bun High School Girl"
msgid "They were really scary! They kept telling him to walk\\r\nfaster!"
msgstr "¡Daban miedo! ¡No paraban de decirle que caminara rápido!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
